rget the neon rain. Welcome to the heat. Here, the sun bleaches the plastic, the sea is a toxic soup, and the shadows of the \"Sky-Line\" towers are the only place to hide.\n\nAfter the global Cascade, the city became a playground for Prospect Corporation. They promised order. They delivered chains. Now rumors spread through the Mesh about a weaponized algorithm called \"Sphere-N\" - and the one man who might hold the key to stopping it.\n\nYou are that man. Not a soldier, but an Engineer searching for his father\u2019s stolen legacy. To uncover the truth, you must navigate the social hierarchy of a dying city: trade scraps with the Limestone Rats, dodge the heavy boots of the Wardens, and descend into the ancient catacombs where technology looks suspiciously like magic. In Odesa, every choice leaves a scar, and every alliance carries a price.", "summary": "Humanity Echo is a tactical turn-based RPG set in the rusted harbour slums of Odesa, 2044.\n\nYou play as an Engineer - not a soldier - using sabotage, environmental manipulation, and raw intellect to outsmart a corporate machine. In this high-tech, low-life world, every explosion carries physical weight and every shot leaves a unique acoustic imprint.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/humanity-echo-cyberpunk-tactical-rpg", "videos": [{"id": 170697, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "x4bZxZyuK64", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x4bZxZyuK64", "title": "Humanity Echo - Cyberpunk Tactical RPG | Official Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/x4bZxZyuK64/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 175844, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "MqlWO9BqEkw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MqlWO9BqEkw", "title": "Humanity Echo - Official Gameplay Trailer | Cyberpunk Turn-Based Tactics RPG", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MqlWO9BqEkw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 192303, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "b